en examples."],"features":["Backend editorX (App level+Shader VisualScripting) (works in local env - desktop browsers) support list: Chrome, Edge, Opera, Firefox desktop.","Code Creator (TheBeast Code generator) is standalone. Can be used public but user must trust page to enter api key.","Canvas is dynamically created in JavaScript—no element needed in HTML.","Access the main scene objects:","Add meshes with .addMeshObj(), supporting .obj loading, unlit textures, cubes, spheres, etc."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/zlatnaspirala/matrix-engine-wgpu/blob/main/readme.md","fingerprint":"e5519c5240d1ae62d256ccca91011e415af3efe75b875fdb155a6849b72f7dca","extractedAt":"2026-10-13T07:38:04.418Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-13T07:38:04.418Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Author: Nikola Lukić 📧 zlatnaspirala@gmail.com 📅 Version: 1.19.0 2026 Alias The beast","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/zlatnaspirala/matrix-engine-wgpu/blob/main/readme.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"Can be used public but user must trust page to enter api key.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/zlatnaspirala/matrix-engine-wgpu/blob/main/readme.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"You need to open account on ollama platform for free quota service.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/zlatnaspirala/matrix-engine-wgpu/blob/main/readme.md"}],"fingerprint":"e5519c5240d1ae62d256ccca91011e415af3efe75b875fdb155a6849b72f7dca","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/zlatnaspirala/matrix-engine-wgpu/blob/main/readme.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-13T07:38:04.419Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-12T21:55:12Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/zlatnaspirala/matrix-engine-wgpu/blob/main/readme.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-13T07:38:04.420Z","hash":"e5519c5240d1ae62d256ccca91011e415af3efe75b875fdb155a6849b72f7dca","originalBytes":47869,"storedBytes":47869,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["npm","engine","run","t